		<description>Light and agile powered helmet designed as combat replacement of the recon armors. In terms of protection, it's a marine armor with reduced weight and increased.</description>
		<techLevel>Spacer</techLevel>
		<tickerType>Normal</tickerType>
		<recipeMaker>
			<unfinishedThingDef>UnfinishedTechArmor</unfinishedThingDef>
